 {
  "id": 7177,
  "name": "Steeped",
  "slug": "steeped",
  "parent": 0,
  "type": "variable",
  "variation": "",
  "permalink": "https://www.dakcoffeeroasters.com/product/steeped/",
  "sku": "COF-STEEPED",
  "short_description": "<p>We are thrilled to partner up with Steeped to offer for the first time in our lineup a (almost) ready-to-drink coffee. After testing out several different options, we are very happy with the result as the aromas and the coffee characteristics are retained. The coffee has been individually dosed, sealed in bags and nitrogen-flushed by Steeped and the coffee is roasted by us (of course!).</p>\n<p>Unlock the flavours of these delicious coffees by simply adding hot filtered water. These brew bags are ideal for home, travels or outdoor adventures without compromising on taste. The box contains 6 or 15 Steeped bags depending on the format you are choosing. In this first edition box, we have Cassis Steeped Bags, The Alchemist Steeped Bags and Milky Cake Steeped Bags.</p>",
  "description": "<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-caSCKo lfLVbb\">\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">For when a kettle and hot water are all you have. Our single-serve brew bags come in two sizes: 6 bags with three coffees, two of each, or 15 bags with three coffees, five of each. This edition features Cassis, The Alchemist and Milky Cake. We roast the coffee in Amsterdam, then Steeped grinds, portions and nitrogen seals each bag to keep the coffee fresh until you open it. Pour, dunk, steep. That’s it.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 cLlFgz\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 NlqKE sc-cMljjf kQRqJb\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n</div>",
